abstract: >-
  Archival architecture/reference package for long-lived AI agents and digital
  organizations. The Z0-A baseline separates replaceable cognition from
  canonical identity, authority, objectives, accepted state, and history.
  This repository package is a FINAL DESIGN BASELINE / NOT PRODUCTION and is
  not a claim of production readiness, AGI, consciousness, biological life,
  legal personhood, proven autonomous evolution, universal exactly-once
  effects, or complete security.
